@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · 怎么用：**大多数人什么都不用做。** 装好后默认是「自动」：插件读取系统代理设置，找到你的代理端口，代理在运行时 `web_fetch` 走代理，代理关掉后自动改为直连。

<p align="center"><img src="docs/images/demo.gif" width="420" alt="演示：切到直连后出现提示，点「改为自动」恢复；关掉代理后自动改为直连"></p>

点侧栏底部的这个小按钮打开面板：

@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · 状态接口：```
GET  /dsh-proxy-switch/state
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/mode      { "mode": "auto" | "forward" | "direct" }
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/settings  { "scope"?, "upstream"?, "upstreamSource"?, "listenPort"?, "probeIntervalMs"? }
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/probe     立即检测一次当前代理

@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · 卸载：1. 对模型说「用 plugin_manager 卸载 dsh-proxy-switch」（`remove_bundle`），然后重启 DSH。
2. 删除 `~/.dsh/storages/dsh-proxy-switch/`。
3. 如果需要恢复写死的代理，把 `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY` 写回 `~/.dsh/.env` 并重启。

@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · What problem it solves：- `web_fetch` fails with **`non-public IP address`**, or says a site resolved to **`198.18.x.x`**;
- your proxy app runs in **TUN / enhanced mode / fake-IP**, and every page fetch fails;
- you only turned on the proxy app's **system proxy** without TUN: DSH does not read the system proxy, so `web_fetch` cannot open sites that need the proxy;
- you hard-coded `HTTP_PROXY` into `~/.dsh/.env` to make `web_fetch` work, and now **even chatting with the model breaks** whenever the proxy is off;
- you edit configuration every time you turn the proxy on or off.

@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · State API：```
GET  /dsh-proxy-switch/state
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/mode      { "mode": "auto" | "forward" | "direct" }
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/settings  { "scope"?, "upstream"?, "upstreamSource"?, "listenPort"?, "probeIntervalMs"? }
POST /dsh-proxy-switch/probe     check the current proxy now

@lightrivers/dsh-proxy-switch README · Uninstall：1. Ask the model to "uninstall dsh-proxy-switch with plugin_manager" (`remove_bundle`), then restart DSH.
2. Delete `~/.dsh/storages/dsh-proxy-switch/`.
3. If you want the hard-coded proxy back, put `HTTP_PROXY` / `HTTPS_PROXY` back into `~/.dsh/.env` and restart.
